    "Le segnalazioni restano separate da previsioni e misure: servono a verificare e calibrare il modello." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reports are kept separate from forecasts and measurements: they are used to verify and calibrate the model."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meldungen bleiben getrennt von Prognosen und Messungen: Sie dienen dazu, das Modell zu prüfen und zu kalibrieren."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
