    "Veðurstofa Íslands (vedur.is), Vegagerðin (umferdin.is), Open-Meteo, NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center, SafeTravel.is. L'app aggrega dati pubblici: in caso di dubbio prevalgono le fonti ufficiali." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veðurstofa Íslands (vedur.is), Vegagerðin (umferdin.is), Open-Meteo, NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center, SafeTravel.is. The app aggregates public data: when in doubt, the official sources prevail."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veðurstofa Íslands (vedur.is), Vegagerðin (umferdin.is), Open-Meteo, NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center, SafeTravel.is. Die App bündelt öffentliche Daten: Im Zweifel gelten die offiziellen Quellen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veðurstofa Íslands (vedur.is), Vegagerðin (umferdin.is), Open-Meteo, NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center, SafeTravel.is. L'app agrège des données publiques : en cas de doute, les sources officielles prévalent."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Veðurstofa Íslands (vedur.is), Vegagerðin (umferdin.is), Open-Meteo, NOAA Space Weather Prediction Center, SafeTravel.is. La app agrega datos públicos: en caso de duda, prevalecen las fuentes oficiales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
